  "scope": "This is a rigorous finite-pool obstruction for exactly 22 pinned base atoms, 6,101 corrected fractional single-open-path grid atoms, thirty exact-rational gapped paths (twenty-eight inherited from the certified 6,151-column pool and two newly Arb-certified escapes from the 6,151-column dual). It does not cover other nonuniform gapped couplings, the continuous gapped family, other arbitrary multi-segment paths, all even principal minors, or an operational Choi/diamond-distance guarantee.",
